{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16755","headline":"楚州赠别周愿侍御 · 陈存","name":"楚州赠别周愿侍御","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"漂泊楚水来，舍舟坐高馆。\n途穷在中路，孤征慕前伴。\n风雨一留宿，关山去欲嬾。\n淮南木叶飞，夜闻广陵散。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陈存","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_16755.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16755","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}